// THE RENDERER IS THE ONE THE FLEET ALREADY BOOTS FROM. (review: merry-fox-82, HOLD section 1) This module
// does not emit YAML and does not imitate the cloud-config writer: it builds the upstream payload record and
// hands it to the same fold os_install uses, so a seed whose payload cannot be written is a seed that cannot
// be bound. Importing the fold rather than restating its output is what makes "the document the machine was
// given" answerable — a local string that merely resembles the payload proves nothing about the document.
import gunbc.os_install_emit { AutoinstallUserData, autoinstall_user_data }
